.set trans -
.. individual settings for this infosystem
..
.. the maximum number of output periods
.formula M|maxperiod  = 2
.copy M|spra = P|spra
..
.. no account ranges with null values
.formula M|kbnonull   = G|false
.. no accounts with null values
.formula M|knonull    = G|false
..
.. consider account range settings for open/close
.formula M|cclosed    = G|true
.. no accounts at all
.formula M|noaccounts = G|true
..
.formula M|maxtiefe   = 99
..
.. no computation of balances or differences
.formula M|novkz      = G|false
..
.. 1 = comparison based on a single period and a single account range value
.. 2 = comparison line by line between periods 1,2 and 3,4
.. 3 = comparison based on a single account range value in the same period
.formula M|verglart   = 2
.. period to compare values to (only used if verglart == 1)
.formula M|verglper   = 1
.. compute planned data
.formula M|mitplan    = G|true
..
.. call standard screen enter FOP
.input "fb/KBFORMBILGUV.ME"
